        <h3>Channel managers: NightsBridge and HTI</h3>
        <p>Already using NightsBridge or HTI (Hospitality Technology International)? We link straight into your existing setup, so your availability and rates stay in sync without any manual updating on your end. Not on a channel manager yet? We&rsquo;ll push your property out to the right platforms — but only if you want us to.</p>
