        <h3>Closed properties</h3>
        <p>A niche option for owners who want the marketing reach without the open-market listing. Closed properties still sit on Avante's platform and still reach the affiliate network — an owner renting out a family home over the December holidays, for example, gets exposure to the right renters without a public search listing.</p>
